{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026qJ8cwDvbtA1794904238.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港小姐季軍兼最上鏡小姐李澤欣（Scarlett）日前（15日）迎來25歲生日，並於社交平台分享多張慶生美照，同時公開新一年的事業目標，收獲不少網民關注與祝福。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8c4256d9-0b3e-4fd9-a8db-b1e498896aed.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026ebhc1UI1q61794904238.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p>從公開的相片可見，李澤欣當晚悉心打扮，身穿一襲黑色細肩帶連身裙，配搭一頭柔順長直髮及簡約頸鏈，于餐廳內慶祝生日。她先是對著鏡頭展露燦爛笑容，隨後雙手合十閉眼誠心許願，並在帖文中感性寫下生日願望：「我想成為一位好嘅主持。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"35967d31-0d10-4849-afcb-e87cf5806688.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026lUoy7htqmA1794904237.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>事實上，李澤欣自當選港姐後已火速展開幕前工作，近期更正式加入《東張西望》擔任外景主持。雖然身為主持界新丁，但她在節目中採訪及報道時口齒伶俐、淡定流暢，自然大方的表現已成功吸引不少觀眾留意，更獲大批網民激讚「有潛質」。不少網民亦紛紛留言為她打氣，期待她未來在主持界發光發熱。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:31:39.779157+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T01:36:51.375487+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:24:59.087583+00:00","content_hash":"380f4846a98c0094eb00a56e3124ca2b9e875670fc84efeb89fe5de7eaf36b06","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:31:39.779157+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}